  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OPC PAO 2019-2022</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OPC PAO 2019-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Inom ramen f&#xf6;r den &#xe4;ndrade strategin f&#xf6;r s&#xe4;rskilt demokratist&#xf6;d genom svenska partianknutna organisationer (PAO) har Olof Palmes Internationella Center (OPC) ans&#xf6;kt om medel fr&#xe5;n Sida f&#xf6;r en insats med det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let; &quot; att de partier och organisationerna som ing&#xe5;r i programmet vid slutet av 2020 har bidragit till demokratisering och diversifiering av det politiska landskapet i sina respektive l&#xe4;nder&quot;. 

Insatsen omfattar f&#xf6;ljande sju program;

-Policy and organisational support programme (PSOP): Southern Africa Social Democratic and Green parties, tillsammans med Green Forum som meds&#xf6;kande
-Global Youth Movements 2019-2020, tillsammans med Centerpartiets internationella stiftelse (CIS) som meds&#xf6;kande
-PAO Latin America programme (PAOLA), tillsammans med Swedish International Liberal Centre (SILC) och Kristdemokratiskt Internationellt Center (KIC) som meds&#xf6;kande
-MENA programme 2019-2020, OPC ensam (men tillsammans med CIS efter 2020)
-Palme Academy programme 2019-2020, OPC ensam
-PAO Western Balkans 2019-2020 tillsammans med CIS som meds&#xf6;kande
-Asia programme 2019-2020, OPC ensam

De program som ing&#xe5;r i den f&#xf6;reslagna ans&#xf6;kan bygger alla p&#xe5; de program som genomf&#xf6;rts under 2016-2018. Av de sju f&#xf6;reslagna programmen ans&#xf6;ker OPC som ensam PAO f&#xf6;r tre program: Palme Academy-programmet, MENA-programmet och Asien-programmet. Planen &#xe4;r emellertid att CIS ansluter sig till MENA-programmet och att Palme Academy- och Asien-programmen utvidgas tillsammans med andra PAOs och/eller internationella organisationer efter 2020.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Olof Palmes Internationella Center (OPC) has submitted an application to Sida under the revised Strategy for Democracy Support through Swedish Party Affiliated Organisations 2016-2020. The overall objective of OPC&#xb4;s application is that: &quot;the parties, and affiliated organisations, included in the programme have, by the end of 2020, contributed to the democratisation and diversification of the political landscape in their respective countries&quot;.
 
The contribution includes the following seven programmes:

-Policy and organisational support programme (PSOP): Southern Africa Social Democratic and Green parties, together with Green Forum as co-applicant.
-Global Youth Movements 2019-2020, together with  Centerpartiets internationella stiftelse (CIS) as co-applicant.
-PAO Latin America programme (PAOLA), together with Swedish International Liberal Centre (SILC) and  Kristdemokratiskt Internationellt Center (KIC)
-MENA programme 2019-2020, OPC alone (but together with CIS from 2021)
-Palme Academy programme 2019-2020, OPC alone
-PAO Western Balkans 2019-2020 together with CIS
-Asia programme 2019-2020, OPC alone

The programmes included in the proposed application are all based on the programmes implemented during 2016-2018. Out of the seven proposed programmes OPC applies as sole PAO for three programmes; Palme Academy programme, the MENA programme and the Asia programme. The plan is however that CIS joins the MENA programme and that the Palme Academy and Asia programmes are expanded together with other PAOs and international organisations after 2020.</narrative>
  </description>
